About neutron-test-midlet

  Neutron build process includes multiple JUnit tests.  CLDC and MIDP API signature validation is done using {{{http://jour.sourceforge.net/}Jour}}.

  Start Neutron Web Start with {{{/neutron-webstart/open-local/~/neutron-tests/neutron-test-midlet/neutron-test-midlet-#version#-test.jnlp}neutron-test-midlet-#version#-test}}.
  This project tests some Neutron functinality using <<{{{http://snapshot.pyx4me.com/pyx4me-cldcunit/}CLDCUnit}}>> J2ME JUnit base test framework.

